{
  "bodyHash": "a1VlHC5b/+g=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_d2a6c0d5-bbcf-4827-a359-f7d38bd24ef4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"> <span style=\"color:#ff1a01\">紅寶石</span><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\">超越獄髓 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_277b2438-b1a1-4377-a1a9-0b3ab7b99f11.png\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"></span></h1><p>這個模組新增了超越獄髓的紅寶石礦物，它會生成在地獄維度的Y=5到Y=31之間。當你開採紅寶石礦物後，會獲得紅寶石碎片，接著你需要在合成檯上將它與鑽石結合，就像獄髓錠的合成配方一樣，才能製作出紅寶石。</p><p>使用紅寶石，你可以在合成檯上製作紅寶石盔甲、工具和武器。</p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#a31b0f\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_1326a45c-10fc-40c1-bd42-67935a507b03.gif\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 如何合成紅寶石？</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#a31b0f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_15846734-b779-49c1-8dc2-420d83710fd3.png\" width=\"357\"></span></p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#123d0e\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_c297ae44-db75-4f1e-a0b1-200bb2a06d09.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> <span style=\"color:#c11708\">孔雀石方塊：</span></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#a31b0f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_ef0c5e24-2e3d-4169-8864-3ea69cdf34c8.png\" width=\"357\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_416c02f4-b306-4305-9e16-fedf8ade4e27.png\" width=\"357\"></span></p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#ba1818\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_413a1ae5-7ab0-4d1f-8cef-5dafd7be12ef.gif\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#a31b0f\">紅寶石盔甲、工具及武器屬性：</span></span></h2><table style=\"width:99.8747%;border:1px solid rgb(126, 10, 10);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.2639%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\">\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#ef3b3b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_b57198a6-53b5-4c1d-aafd-e240f4c14e3c.gif\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\"> 盔甲</span></strong></h3>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:13.197%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>頭盔</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:19.145%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>胸甲</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:15.7993%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>護腿</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5948%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>靴子</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.2639%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; 盔甲值</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.197%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>+4</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:19.145%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>+9</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:15.7993%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>+7</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5948%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>+4</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.2639%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; 盔甲強度</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.197%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>4</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:19.145%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>4</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:15.7993%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>4</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5948%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>4</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.2639%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; 抗擊退</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.197%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>+20%</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:19.145%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>+20%</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:15.7993%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>+20%</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5948%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>+20%</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.2639%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; 耐久度</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.197%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>451</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:19.145%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>656</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:15.7993%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>615</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5948%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>533</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_1e71155c-249f-40b4-9c95-edda41a23784.png\" width=\"357\" height=\"204\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_23e3fa7e-de45-4ffd-ad57-fb151998ecc3.png\" width=\"357\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_44c1dd1a-4467-43c4-8be0-aad68d5d44a3.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_edb277b5-57f1-493f-a96d-9bf7b8eb927d.png\" width=\"357\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"width:99.8747%;border:1px solid rgb(126, 10, 10);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.4268%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\">\n<h3><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_eb2ae853-0c22-41fc-bd6f-847c3fa60ee1.gif\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#ef3b3b\">工具</span></strong></h3>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:11.1389%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>劍</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:12.6408%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>鎬</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.5169%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>斧</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.388%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>鏟</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.8886%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>鋤</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.4268%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; 攻擊傷害</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:11.1389%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>9</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:12.6408%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>7</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.5169%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>11</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.388%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>3.75</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.8886%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>1</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.4268%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; 挖掘效率</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:11.1389%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>11</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:12.6408%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>11</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.5169%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>11</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.388%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>11</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.8886%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>11</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.4268%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; 攻擊速度</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:11.1389%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>1.6</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:12.6408%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>1.2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.5169%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>1</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.388%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>1</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.8886%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>4</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.4268%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; 耐久度</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:11.1389%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>4062</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:12.6408%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>4062</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.5169%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>4062</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.388%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>4062</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.8886%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>4062</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_b2e4dc48-fd0d-4ac3-992c-60fec0193bfa.png\" width=\"357\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_a7a765e2-2675-427f-87c6-9090814a93fb.png\" width=\"357\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_4bdce5c9-e500-4293-a5e7-94c25f88d7f7.png\" width=\"357\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_a8c7937e-7b3d-4ca1-9a8d-75b696756b50.png\" width=\"357\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_b464dc75-b8a1-40a6-ae95-213a66f7699f.png\" width=\"357\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"width:99.8747%;border:1px solid rgb(126, 10, 10);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:52.5657%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\">\n<h3><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_f559b94c-bace-4eaf-a549-2803e