<strong>4062</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:17.1464%;border-color:rgb(126, 10, 10);border-width:1px\"><strong>4062</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_323796cc-09d0-4d05-936a-26bb5da4fe51.png\" width=\"357\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_5e96777b-71c5-44fb-8633-7f256e4f01e7.png\" width=\"357\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_7dfeee7b-f375-4775-9d28-5323ee520232.png\" width=\"357\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_bb07eab6-5bf6-4ca0-828c-4e900c1292f6.png\" width=\"795\" height=\"389\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_1a87c9ad-fec9-4f72-84a9-2d73fbcabe58.png\" width=\"1213\" height=\"152\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_20c6fac0-e56c-4259-8cff-3d3d65f108c8.png\" width=\"806\" height=\"790\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_5c6a2147-d69b-4715-a787-c76b5bf3da3e.png\" width=\"802\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_fd7faa26-fbf1-46fa-8e93-a7ea4d15476d.png\" width=\"802\"></p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba0a0a\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_73fa45c0-5496-4190-aa24-a156e946aa18.gif\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"> 鑲邊紅寶石盔甲 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_2f2da8f6-4958-4f90-933b-eed14d3fee98.gif\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"></span></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h2><span style=\"color:#ad0ae4\">紫水晶：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_c829a01e-fadd-4b6b-924d-096a10d44771.png\" width=\"772\" height=\"121\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#cd601f\">銅：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_4c00c51f-f834-467c-a22c-c819b373cb2c.png\" width=\"772\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#08c9e4\">鑽石：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_39ec3f1e-4576-48c6-b5a2-d59ca131d639.png\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#24c439\">綠寶石：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_fb5c5acc-402f-4944-9515-86ac9e03a9b3.png\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">金：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_ba88fef7-ad63-4b84-8630-8b9ac7700986.png\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">鐵：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_eb24e793-33e1-4f44-8dfb-2adc03f012e1.png\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2950fa\">青金石：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_74aa7db0-ff37-43ce-bb90-094004e0422f.png\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#313030\">獄髓：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_48e93c27-22f3-4984-8920-445c2b7c1415.png\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#ddd6d6\">石英：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_407bce47-911d-40af-b6e2-40a56567384a.png\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fc1111\">紅石：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_a2252d4f-392d-4caa-aefa-87fd6a2925f1.png\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">樹脂：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1a01\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073742/description_78e64729-ac1f-474e-927f-072fd7c9a3c8.png\"></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba1818\">更新日誌：</span></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>5.5.0 修正模組大小問題，更新裝飾紋樣，並稍微調整遊戲內說明、創造模式標籤、進度及西班牙語</p>\n<p>5.0.0 新增可對紅寶石盔甲進行裝飾紋樣，並改善遊戲內說明</p>\n<p>4.5.0 全面更改紅寶石紋理並重新設計，新增西班牙語翻譯及模組遊戲內說明，並修復部分錯誤</p>\n<p>4.0.0 修正盔甲紋理錯誤，新增一個進度，並修復另外兩個進度</p>\n<p>3.5.0 新增與村民的交易、模組專屬創造模式標籤、微調物品紋理、進度，並修復部分合成配方錯誤</p>\n<p>3.0.0 新增挖掘機，並微調大部分紋理</p>\n<p>2.5.0 新增成就、錘子，並解決紅寶石礦生成錯誤</p>\n<p>2.0.0 修正紅寶石礦生成問題</p>\n<p>1.5.0 新增紅寶石鎬鏟斧</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#0dc10d\">我的其他模組：</span></h1><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/only-paxel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1196993/description_981c06d9-c927-4767-b3b1-de3cdf7e9bff.gif\" width=\"380\" height=\"380\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superior-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073848/description_a19c40e0-c7f0-4efc-8171-3236ec432043.gif\" width=\"379\" height=\"379\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/only-hammers-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1196993/description_c86d40b9-dd72-4e14-b7ed-d6085e53689c.gif\" width=\"380\" height=\"380\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-emerald-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/descripti